    "body": "Declarations and definitions tend to drift apart. We could align these, and then enforce that via `clang-tidy`s `readability-inconsistent-declaration-parameter-name` check: https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/checks/readability/inconsistent-declaration-parameter-name.html. \n\nThis may not be worth the (initial) churn / we may also be fine with inconsistency here. Also need to decide which side to align on in some cases.\n\nCurrently drafted, as it's based on changes from #36743 to avoid changing could-be-deleted lines twice.",
